{"product_id":"the-pepins-and-their-problems","title":"The Pepins and Their Problems","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhether it's waking up to find toads in their shoes, becoming trapped on the roof, or searching for cheese when their cow makes only lemonade, the Pepin family always seem to get into the most bizarre scrapes. Lucky for them, they have an author with large psychic antennae and great problem-solving readers who can join the Pepins on their hilarious adventures. And they need all the help they can get!\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 134 x 196\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Polly Horvath | Marylin Hafner\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780312377519\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 208\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45744223191193,"sku":"16RB-2-9780312377519","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68d3d6bb200c5_The_Pepins_and_Their_Problems_Polly_Horvath___Marylin_Hafner.jpg?v=1758732817","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/the-pepins-and-their-problems","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}